# Captain Burak's laugh cut, in the user's own wording: it plays once, after the fight's first volley of
# kegs lands all five blasts. The "do" line plays his laughing fit (in BurakBossLaugh.gd), and the dialogue
# waits for it. Danny heckles from ringside and has no node in the arena; `deafened` is his ringing ears.
# Never [wait=N] or "do wait(N)" in here (see BurakBossPreFight.dialogue).

~ start
do bursts_out_laughing()
Captain Burak: ...pfffft.... hahahahaha! I've never seen someone get hit by all 5 barrels! Hahahahaha! Danny did you see that? [#captain=laugh, #glance=left]
Danny: .... [#deafened]
Captain Burak: Engarde! [#captain=point]
=> END
